        "eyebrow": "ABOUT THE PROJECT",
        "about": "## *Team Forest* is a campaign harnessing football’s unique ability to unite people across the world – **rallying everyone to show their support for the world’s forests.**\n\nThe campaign film features professional footballers and stunt performers running, leaping and soaring through the forest floor, up tree trunks and across the canopy to **illustrate how protecting the forest is a game we all need to play together.**",
