    {
      "id": "quote-7",
      "type": "quote",
      "content": {
        "quote": "\"It’s rare to get the opportunity to combine the world’s biggest sport with our biggest love, nature. Football has the unique ability to unite people across borders, cultures, and generations through joy and passion. With this campaign, we wanted to channel that spirit to the forests we all depend on, bringing people together through positivity and collective action to stand with nature.\"",
        "cite": "Directors Jorik Dozy & Sil van der Woerd"
      }
    },
